    {
      "id": "end_navi",
      "text": "You and Neytiri lead a generation. You hold the sky people back. You teach your children both languages. They prefer the older one.",
      "sceneTitle": "Olo'eyktan",
      "choices": [],
      "isEnding": true,
      "endingTitle": "Olo'eyktan"
    },
    {
      "id": "end_bridge",
      "text": "You broker, slowly, a peace between Pandora and a chastened RDA. The mining shrinks. The science stays. Grace, before she died, would have laughed.",
      "sceneTitle": "Bridge Between Worlds",
      "choices": [],
      "isEnding": true,
      "endingTitle": "Bridge Between Worlds"
    },
    {
      "id": "end_eywa",
      "text": "Eventually you die. Your consciousness joins the network of the tree. Children, walking the forest, hear your voice in the wind. They take it for granted, the way you would have, once.",
      "sceneTitle": "Inside Eywa",
      "choices": [],
      "isEnding": true,
